== Result
Your verdict is plain text, not JSON. Tandem builds the JSON, so nothing needs escaping. Write it like this:

status: OUTCOME

finding: SEVERITY DISPOSITION PATH[:START[-END]]
The message, on as many lines as you need. Write quotes, backslashes and code exactly as they are.

OUTCOME is passed, changes_requested or failed. Start each finding with its own finding: line. SEVERITY is critical, high, medium, low or info. DISPOSITION is open, fixed or rejected. START and END are optional 1-based line numbers. changes_requested must list at least one finding. A passed verdict cannot leave blocking findings unresolved. Tandem supplies the job, attempt, patch and tree from the stored job. Edit only the verdict file; do not edit source files.

